  "releaseNotes": "Single multi-targeted package (netstandard2.0 / net8.0 / net9.0 / net10.0) replacing the separate 2.0.0.x .NET Standard line. Payloads are now built with Utf8JsonWriter, so subjects, bodies and file names containing quotes, backslashes or newlines are escaped correctly instead of corrupting the request. Adds CancellationToken support, shared HttpClient reuse, MSAL token-cache reuse, and an injectable HttpClient for testing.",
